  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat the coconut oil in a large pan over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add the chicken and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "3. Add the garlic, black pepper, and adobo seasoning. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "4. Pour in the vinegar and soy sauce. Stir to combine.",
    "5. Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10-15 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "6. Taste and adjust the seasoning with sugar if needed.",
    "7. Serve hot over rice."
